      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Arrastraron la red por el río, y dos veces Loki se les escapó.",
          "en": "They dragged the net through the river, and twice Loki slipped away."
        },
        {
          "es": "La tercera vez, Loki saltó por encima de la red hacia la cascada. Thor, que vadeaba el río, lo agarró al vuelo.",
          "en": "The third time, Loki leapt over the net toward the waterfall. Thor, wading through the river, caught him in mid-air."
        },
        {
          "es": "El salmón resbaló entre sus dedos, y Thor solo pudo sujetarlo con fuerza por la cola.",
          "en": "The salmon slid between his fingers, and Thor could only grip it hard by the tail."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso, hasta hoy, el salmón tiene la cola tan delgada.",
          "en": "That is why, to this day, the salmon has such a narrow tail."
        },
        {
          "es": "Loki recobró su forma de dios, y ya no tuvo adónde huir.",
          "en": "Loki took his own shape again, and there was nowhere left to run."
        }
